OL,3,GNEWSARoof and bridge installed as new
OL,4,Atheatre takes shape
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe roof of Reading's new Studio
OL,7,FTheatre has been installed and the
OL,8,Fauditorium is starting to take shape,
OL,9,Fthe council behind the plan has said.
OL,11,FThe new theatre at The Hexagon will
OL,12,Fhave capacity for 200 seated guests or
OL,13,Ffor up to 300 people in standing
OL,14,Fevents, with a planned opening in the
OL,15,Fspring.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
