OL,3,GNEWSARoof and bridge installed as new
OL,4,Atheatre takes shape
OL,5,
OL,6,FReading Borough Council said, with
OL,7,Fseating on the ground floor and a
OL,8,Fgallery, it would be "ideal for comedy
OL,9,Fshows, live music and other
OL,10,Fperformances" and forms part of a
OL,11,Fregeneration project for the theatre
OL,12,Fand the surrounding area.
OL,14,FA new pedestrian walkway to give
OL,15,Fvisitors step-free access from Queen's
OL,16,FWalk to The Hexagon and the Studio
OL,17,FTheatre was unveiled last week.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
